keywords ninth meridian rite catastrophe
---
The Ninth Meridian catastrophe followed the failed rite meant to reconcile solar and underworld sovereignty doctrines.
Instead of reconciliation, the event marked cosmological incompatibility and accelerated corridor fragmentation.
Its thermal pulse is tied to wider eastern geological consequences, including formation of the Saltglass Reach's Glasswind Belts.
The catastrophe became proof text for later factions arguing that mixed doctrine can destabilize both law and landscape.
